			"content": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"text": "Keeping the claim honest"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"content": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"text": "Those fixtures were captured from cookbook recipes on a date, and the Cookbook keeps changing. A scheduled, advisory job — "
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"text": ".github/workflows/recipe-drift.yml",
					"marks": [
						{
							"type": "code"
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"type": "text",
					"text": " — fetches the live recipes weekly and reports where the recipe catalog, the vendored manifests or a fixture's pinned manifest and canvas no longer match what iiif.io publishes. It files a GitHub issue; it never fails a build, and it is never a required check. A maintainer decides what to update."
				}
			],
			"attrs": {
				"id": "14996b58-136f-46d8-9f2d-3b232db15f4e"
			}
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"content": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"text": "Run it locally against the live Cookbook:"
				}
			],
			"attrs": {
				"id": "5dfe81d6-1bdd-423b-8a6f-295564f2d431"
			}
		},
		{
			"type": "codeBlock",
			"attrs": {
				"language": "bash",
				"id": "3629af31-8c2d-48b3-a49d-6bf4f4b73dbf"
			},
			"content": [
				{
					"type": "text",
					"text": "node scripts/recipe-drift.mjs                        # all 67 cataloged recipes\nnode scripts/recipe-drift.mjs --recipe 0009-book-1   # spot-check one"
				}
			]
		}
	],
